    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "id": "62139b6d",
   "doc": "wp-page#98840",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "embed",
     "kind": "video",
     "src": "https://capecodcannabis.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Strane-Purgatory.mov",
     "settings": {
      "video_type": "hosted",
      "mute": "yes",
      "controls": "yes"
     }
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Strane’s Purgatory offers an experience for cannabis enthusiasts seeking high-quality flower for a great price that delivers on all fronts. With its earthy, gassy, and subtly sweet aroma, Purgatory stands out for its dense nug structure adorned with glistening trichomes.</p><p>Despite its modest THC levels, Purgatory surpasses many strains boasting higher percentages, delivering a smooth smoking experience and potent effects. Ideal for a relaxing movie night, its effects provide a perfect blend of relaxation without overwhelming sedation depending on how much you consume.</p><p>This strain comes highly recommended for anyone seeking to unwind after a long day, whether it’s at the beach, work, or exploring Cape Cod. Strane’s Purgatory ensures a consistently enjoyable and relaxing evening.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
