  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "id": "3421dcb6",
   "doc": "wp-page#98840",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "embed",
     "kind": "video",
     "src": "https://capecodcannabis.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Glorious-Cannabis-Co-Lemon-Cherry-Gelato.mov",
     "settings": {
      "video_type": "hosted",
      "mute": "yes",
      "controls": "yes"
     }
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Lemon Cherry Gelato from Glorious Cannabis Co is an excellent choice for discerning cannabis users seeking a high-quality flower to unwind with towards the end of the day. This strain exudes sweet, creamy, and earthy undertones that enhance the smoking experience, reminiscent of a dessert strain due to its pronounced sweetness. Those who prefer less sweetness in their smoke may find its sweeter smoking profile less appealing.</p><p>The nug structure of Lemon Cherry Gelato is notably dense, comprising smaller-sized nugs that grind perfectly for easy preparation. Featuring a striking blend of dark purple and light green hues, its appearance adds to its appeal.</p><p>The effects of Lemon Cherry Gelato hit the mark, providing a balanced experience that combines calming effects with sociability, uplifting the user into a happy and content state. This makes it ideal for those looking to take the edge off while remaining functional enough to tackle activities like yard work, enjoying a late-night fire, or simply relaxing.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
