     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/garcia-limefire-skunk-qq01g8c0f2lc76zxklvsmnqh6u7xwk7ueaweea7na8.jpeg?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "garcia-limefire-skunk",
     "titleAttr": "garcia-limefire-skunk"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Limefire Skunk by Garcia Hand Picked stands as a personal favorite of mine, offering a comprehensive experience from its exceptional flower quality to its flavorful smoke. This strain is an excellent investment for those seeking top-tier cannabis.</p><p>Characterized by an enticing blend of old-school funk with a contemporary twist, Limefire Skunk leaves a memorable impression with its bold aroma upon opening. The nug structure features large, dense nugs generously coated in trichomes, exemplifying its premium quality.</p><p>The effects of Limefire Skunk are versatile, suitable for any time of day depending on ones desired outcomes. It delivers a happy and uplifting experience while also providing me relief from muscle pains, making it a multifaceted choice for consumers.</p>"
    }
   ]
