    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Bubble Yum by Perpetual presents itself as a delightful strain, notable for its balanced hybrid nature and beneficial effects. This semi-sweet strain offers a nuanced profile that combines earthy undertones with a hint of sweetness, making it a distinct choice for cannabis enthusiasts.</p><p>Despite its smaller nug size, Bubble Yum impresses with its potency and abundant trichome coverage, ensuring a robust experience with every session. It’s important to note that its sweeter smoking profile may not appeal to those preferring less sweetness in their smoke.</p><p>This strain is well-suited for individuals seeking a relaxing yet functional experience during afternoons or evenings. Bubble Yum by Perpetual is an ideal companion for unwinding while maintaining productivity.</p>"
    }
   ]
